    faqSelectionAnswer: "All three meadows are available on the map from the start. A correct answer offers the next meadow. Selecting any meadow starts its valves at zero; there is no saved unlock sequence.",
    faqTotalExampleQuestion: "Why can the total be correct while my answer is wrong?",
    faqTotalExampleAnswer: "In the first meadow, 2 · 3 · 1 totals 6. The settings 3 · 2 · 1 also total 6, but the first two valves are wrong. Change valve 1 from 3 to 2 and valve 2 from 2 to 3, then check. The feedback names the first mismatch, not every mismatch.",
